        "created_at": "2017-07-11T13:54:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was just reading through some song lyrics while at work, and I suddenly had a thought: What type of music do the characters from Sentinels Comics listen to?</p><p>Personally I think Setback, after watching their show one Saturday morning, would be a fan of the Aquabats. They've got a positive energy that I think he could relate to, and their song 'Just Can't Lose!' is perfect for him.</p><p>Here's a link to the song: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N7fBJ7DrngM</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:49:41.818Z",
