        "created_at": "2017-07-20T14:42:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I might be out of line, but I see Unity as a boy band groupie girl.</p><p>I suspect that Tachyon would enjoy the mathematical nature of lots of baroque music.&nbsp;</p><p>Fixer's taste would depend on when in the timeline you are, with lots of Motown and Soul during his Black Fist era, moving into the kind of rock that was listening inspiration for the World of Darkness in the time before taking up the mantle a Mr. Fixer. But I think there would be plenty of John Lee Hooker in there, too.</p>",
